<title>SPAIN: Spain's Acerinox H1 profit rises 42 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Acerinox H1 profit rises 42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for first half 1997 (in billions of pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p> Net profit				 13.43   up 42 pct</p>
<p> Turnover				  111.88   up 22 pct</p>
<p> Depreciation				6.62   up 40 pct</p>
<p> Net cash flow			    20.05   up 42 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name Grupo Acerinox SA. The steel producer did not provide comparison figures. The parent company said it had a net profit of 11.93 billion pesetas, a 34 percent increase from the same period last year. Acerinox said the results were &quot;satisfactory&quot; despite a 15 percent drop in stainless steel prices.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 215</p>
</text>
